# Local and frozen experiment outputs are never part of the paper code upload.
**/99_Local_Outputs_Not_Uploaded/*
!**/99_Local_Outputs_Not_Uploaded/README.md
**/results/
**/checkpoints/
**/frozen_data/
**/source_snapshots/
*.mat
*.fig
*.png
*.pdf
*.log
*.tmp
**/__pycache__/

